patrone-file-manager (0.2.6) resolute; urgency=medium

  * The title bars follow the title bar style chosen in Patrone Settings,
    as every other app's do: raised when the window is active (Studio's
    grey gradient, Royal's glossy blue) and flat when it isn't. The tab
    strip and the dialogs' title bars are header bars for style sheets now
    (util::header_box), and the selected tab keeps its own colors on any
    style.

